        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Jackson\n- Products: \"Beat It\", Thriller\n- Places: Westlake Recording Studios, Los Angeles\n- Topics: album recording\n\nFacts:\n- Thriller is Michael Jackson's sixth solo album, and it was released in 1982.\n- \"Beat It\" is a song written and performed by American singer Michael Jackson, and it was released as a single from Thriller.\n- Recording sessions for Thriller took place from April to November 1982 at Westlake Recording Studios in Los Angeles.\n- Thriller had a production budget of $750,000.",
